        <object id="overview-13" label="&lt;b&gt;History available at decision t&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Conditioning observations&lt;br&gt;Execution frames strictly before t&lt;br&gt;XYZRGB + state + available&lt;br&gt;preceding commands" tooltip="Source: training/data.py and batched_policy.py. Conditioning and execution are separate source-local histories. Future observations never enter the context. model.condition_on_previous_joint_commands=false zeros the seven commanded joints in both current and historical inputs; measured state and the previous gripper command remain.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
