        <object id="encoders-41" label="&lt;b&gt;2 Transformer encoder layers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;8-head self-attention · width 256&lt;br&gt;FFN: 256 → 512 → 256 with ReLU&lt;br&gt;Residual connections + post LayerNorm&lt;br&gt;Dropout = 0; no causal text mask" tooltip="text_encoder.py: TextEncoder. Standard PyTorch TransformerEncoderLayer (norm_first=False). Instruction text is available as a whole at each decision.">
