        <object id="context-17" label="&lt;b&gt;Allocated context length · batched tensor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lpad = 264 · maxᵢ(⌈Hcᵢ/8⌉ + ⌈Heᵢ/8⌉) + 35&lt;br&gt;Context tensor: [B, Lpad, 256]; mask: [B, Lpad]&lt;br&gt;Partial source blocks and short examples occupy padded slots.&lt;br&gt;Attention masks every invalid slot; no history truncation.&lt;br&gt;Teacher leaf mass = 1, so valid log-mass attention bias = 0." tooltip="batched_policy.py: full_history_context / packed context. Conditioning and execution are blocked separately per example. Only the fine-leaf bank is assembled; hierarchy parents are not built in the teacher tensor path.">
