        <object id="context-36" label="&lt;b&gt;Decision batching and compute&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Global effective batch: 256 decisions/update&lt;br&gt;Microbatch cap: 64 decisions/device/pass&lt;br&gt;4 GPUs: 64 decisions/device/pass × 1 pass/update&lt;br&gt;1 GPU: 64 decisions/pass × 4 passes/update&lt;br&gt;Historical encoder block batch: 128&lt;br&gt;CPU loader workers: 8/rank; prefetch factor: 1&lt;br&gt;Activation checkpointing: false&lt;br&gt;100,000 optimizer updates · AdamW · learning rate 0.0001&lt;br&gt;Auto precision prefers BF16; geometry/reductions remain FP32.&lt;br&gt;CPU workers pack prepared points/center indices, not learned features." tooltip="Decision batching and compute&#10;Global effective batch: 256 decisions/update&#10;Microbatch cap: 64 decisions/device/pass&#10;4 GPUs: 64 decisions/device/pass × 1 pass/update&#10;1 GPU: 64 decisions/pass × 4 passes/update&#10;Historical encoder block batch: 128&#10;CPU loader workers: 8/rank; prefetch factor: 1&#10;Activation checkpointing: false&#10;100,000 optimizer updates · AdamW · learning rate 0.0001&#10;Auto precision prefers BF16; geometry/reductions remain FP32.&#10;CPU workers pack prepared points/center indices, not learned features.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
