          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="context-37" label="&lt;b&gt;Weights are small; history activations can be large&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FP32 parameter storage: 24.39 MB&lt;br&gt;Weights + gradients + two FP32 Adam moments: ~97.58 MB&lt;br&gt;These figures exclude activations, attention workspace and CUDA.&lt;br&gt;Autocast does not change the stored FP32 parameter count.&lt;br&gt;Each DDP rank holds a replica; GPU memory is not pooled." tooltip="Weights are small; history activations can be large&#10;FP32 parameter storage: 24.39 MB&#10;Weights + gradients + two FP32 Adam moments: ~97.58 MB&#10;These figures exclude activations, attention workspace and CUDA.&#10;Autocast does not change the stored FP32 parameter count.&#10;Each DDP rank holds a replica; GPU memory is not pooled.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
