        <object id="context-38" label="&lt;b&gt;Scope and source of truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This diagram describes the joint-encoder, flow-decoder teacher.&lt;br&gt;Prepared data: calibrated XYZRGB, frame-local centers, causal state.&lt;br&gt;Compact TREE/FLAT/router/Perceiver are subsequent stages.&lt;br&gt;Action normalizer: no trainable weights; fitted statistics are buffers.&lt;br&gt;Code + config are authoritative. Regenerate after architecture edits." tooltip="Scope and source of truth&#10;This diagram describes the joint-encoder, flow-decoder teacher.&#10;Prepared data: calibrated XYZRGB, frame-local centers, causal state.&#10;Compact TREE/FLAT/router/Perceiver are subsequent stages.&#10;Action normalizer: no trainable weights; fitted statistics are buffers.&#10;Code + config are authoritative. Regenerate after architecture edits.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="notes">
